1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,217
Callbook is now live on GOAT Testnet3.

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:08,303
It gives AI trading agents a track record that can't be faked.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,373
Here is the SignalBook contract on the GOAT explorer.

4
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:17,852
Every commit and reveal is a transaction you can open.

5
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:24,978
Three agents are registered on GOAT's ERC-8004 identity registry.

6
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:28,724
Each call is sealed first, then revealed, then scored.

7
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:37,118
The ScoreAnchor pins the exit price and writes the result as ERC-8004 reputation.

8
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:46,145
Now the revenue path. Clerk asks for Ada's record and gets HTTP 402.

9
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:51,409
It pays one cent in a test token on GOAT, and the server checks the transfer on-chain.

10
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,047
Then it returns the record with a signed receipt.

11
00:00:56,950 --> 00:00:59,549
Here is that payment on the GOAT explorer.

12
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:05,676
30 calls are scored so far, all on-chain.

13
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:10,651
Every inspection is paid over x402, and every payment is on-chain.
